# A creature dying at the same time as Hushbringer, Hushbringer included, doesn't cause abilities to trigger (the
# rulings): a dies ability looks back to the board as it was before the event (CR 603.10a), and Hushbringer was on it.
# Worldspine Wurm's own game, with Bot2's Hushbringer out before the Wrath of God: the Wrath destroys both, and no Wurm
# tokens are made, while the Wurm's own "put into a graveyard from anywhere" ability still shuffles it into the library
# (it triggers on the board after the event, where Hushbringer no longer is).

